        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Franco Dragone\n- Shows: Le Rêve, Mystère, O, La Nouba, Alegría, Quidam\n- Organizations: Cirque du Soleil\n- Places: Treasure Island Hotel and Casino, Las Vegas, Nevada, United States\n\nFacts:\n- Mystère was first performed on December 25, 1993.\n- Mystère is a Cirque du Soleil show in permanent residence at the Treasure Island Hotel and Casino in Las Vegas, Nevada, United States.\n- Franco Dragone was the director behind O, La Nouba, Mystère, Alegría, and Quidam.\n- Franco Dragone created the production Le Rêve.\n- Le Rêve is similar to shows produced by Cirque du Soleil.\n- Franco Dragone has not revealed the cost of the production Le Rêve.",
